{"src":"it","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":241600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"it","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11779.260922000001,"text":"Se avete visto il film Il mistero dei Templari, potreste pensare che sul retro della dichiarazione di indipendenza sia disegnata una mappa del tesoro."},{"kind":"text","t":12653.330199,"text":"If you’ve seen the movie The Templar Code, you might think a treasure map is drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":12756.069305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12760.789652000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":12765.764775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12770.915615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12776.305301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12781.962373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":12782.438824,"samples":5592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17687.947461,"text":"La cioccolata calda è allo stesso livello di quella belga."},{"kind":"text","t":18062.386602000002,"text":"The hot chocolate is on par with Belgian chocolate."},{"kind":"audio","t":18142.11014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18143.635673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18144.332791,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":22541.708291,"text":"I succhi di frutta sono costosi, ma molto buoni."},{"kind":"text","t":22916.84711,"text":"Fruit juices are expensive, but very good."},{"kind":"audio","t":23005.321665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23010.383966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23012.795604,"samples":21464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":26941.667445,"text":"Comunque questo è falso."},{"kind":"text","t":27190.204875,"text":"Anyway, this is false."},{"kind":"audio","t":27280.185654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27282.563622,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":33243.132614999995,"text":"Anche se sul retro del documento c'è scritto qualcosa."},{"kind":"text","t":33678.544631,"text":"Even though there’s something written on the back of the document."},{"kind":"audio","t":33772.261544999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33777.305256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33783.009266999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":33783.308882,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37597.625063,"text":"Non si tratta di una mappa del tesoro."},{"kind":"text","t":37873.901958999995,"text":"It’s not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":37952.549605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37954.817345999996,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":49641.681091,"text":"Ti potrebbero anche interessare i pareri di governi diversi dal tuo, ma tieni comunque presente che tali pareri sono mirati ai cittadini di quei governi."},{"kind":"text","t":50580.611665,"text":"You might also be interested in the opinions of governments other than yours, but keep in mind that such opinions are aimed at the citizens of those governments."},{"kind":"audio","t":50696.873235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50701.960845999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50707.196013999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50712.173016999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50717.497225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50722.687313999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50726.986098999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":50728.581661,"samples":19024,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":58522.722744,"text":"L'isola di Hong Kong, che dà il suo nome all'intero territorio, rappresenta per molti turisti la meta principale."},{"kind":"text","t":59194.910055,"text":"Hong Kong Island, which gives its name to the entire territory, is the main destination for many tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":59300.709608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59305.593222999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59311.510948999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59316.944473999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59322.35084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59326.199822999995,"samples":26360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":70410.412772,"text":"Chiunque decida di guidare ad altitudini elevate o sui passi montani deve tenere in considerazione la possibilità di neve."},{"kind":"text","t":71135.048148,"text":"Anyone who decides to drive at high elevations or on mountain passes must keep in mind the possibility of snow."},{"kind":"audio","t":71243.15681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71248.353569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71253.356872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71258.74850799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":71263.981447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71269.283464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":71270.429674,"samples":13992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73713.730027,"text":"ghiaccio o di temperature vicino allo zero."},{"kind":"text","t":73980.098916,"text":"ice or temperatures near zero."},{"kind":"audio","t":74061.73796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74066.90797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":74067.250614,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":84633.084225,"text":"Generazione dopo generazione, segregazioni e ricombinazione."},{"kind":"text","t":84972.631916,"text":"Generation after generation, segregation and recombination."},{"kind":"audio","t":85066.146803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85067.615047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85069.118221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85069.865698,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":90357.196117,"text":"ridistribuiscono la variabilità avanti e indietro."},{"kind":"text","t":90636.440471,"text":"They redistribute variability back and forth."},{"kind":"audio","t":90727.719386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90729.572454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90730.190273,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":92492.660336,"text":"tra i due pool."},{"kind":"text","t":92718.04967,"text":"between the two pools."},{"kind":"audio","t":92809.031751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92811.23598299999,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":100176.08070199999,"text":"Il termine acaro è usato formalmente dagli entomologi per questo gruppo di insetti."},{"kind":"text","t":100708.19784,"text":"Entomologists use the term acarid formally for this group of insects."},{"kind":"audio","t":100805.809346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":100811.11652299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100816.356851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100820.586068,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":112828.79126099999,"text":"Per prima cosa, la maggior parte dei cavalieri indossa stivali d'equitazione dotati di tacco e di una suola liscia e piuttosto sottile."},{"kind":"text","t":113521.393987,"text":"Firstly, most riders wear equestrian boots with a heel and a smooth, relatively thin sole."},{"kind":"audio","t":113624.430087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113629.737765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113635.083911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113640.092424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113645.52896899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":113645.846293,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119143.720095,"text":"La Commissione ha costituito la risposta di Martelli."},{"kind":"text","t":119467.73206699999,"text":"The Commission formulated Martelli’s response."},{"kind":"audio","t":119562.773168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119567.864349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119571.56445399999,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":124214.205351,"text":"alle diffuse proteste. Iniziate a ottobre."},{"kind":"text","t":124554.351171,"text":"in response to the widespread protests. Start in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":124650.418763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124655.966457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":124656.802262,"samples":11864,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":124743.893421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124744.729306,"samples":13432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":127807.85326599999,"text":"che contestano il regime."},{"kind":"text","t":128055.930494,"text":"those who challenge the regime."},{"kind":"audio","t":128146.58308099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128150.120929,"samples":27832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":134291.986955,"text":"Le squadre antincendio alla fine sono riuscite a domare il fuoco alle 23.35."},{"kind":"text","t":134956.19284600002,"text":"The fire crews finally managed to bring the fire under control at 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":135061.255272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135066.660207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135071.63646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135077.34650100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135078.62608800002,"samples":31528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":142087.07498200002,"text":"Nella giornata di oggi si è formata nell'oceano Atlantico"},{"kind":"text","t":142439.39211900003,"text":"Today, a storm formed in the Atlantic Ocean"},{"kind":"audio","t":142521.64249300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142527.06929800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142529.094373,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":148103.98432000002,"text":"La decima tempesta della stagione degli uragani atlantici."},{"kind":"text","t":148455.755337,"text":"The tenth storm of the Atlantic hurricane season."},{"kind":"audio","t":148539.01520300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148544.569366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148547.19823,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":152367.727404,"text":"il ciclone subtropicale Jerry."},{"kind":"text","t":152657.599282,"text":"Subtropical cyclone Jerry."},{"kind":"audio","t":152745.63051400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152750.281213,"samples":32632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":160773.996247,"text":"Grazie alla sua invenzione hanno fatto la loro comparsa il treno."},{"kind":"text","t":161147.366037,"text":"Thanks to his invention, trains came into existence."},{"kind":"audio","t":161242.16172200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161247.14292500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161253.318677,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":161253.69347,"samples":5496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":165953.392961,"text":"L'automobile e diversi altri mezzi di trasporto."},{"kind":"text","t":166308.985871,"text":"The automobile and various other modes of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":166397.83863900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":166402.86791200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166408.22421800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":166408.66447000002,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":175648.849201,"text":"La sua notorietà come centro nevralgico del lusso ebbe inizio intorno al 400 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":176172.53857600002,"text":"Its reputation as a hub of luxury began around 400 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":176269.62986100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176274.802201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":176280.039889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176285.72635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":176285.87738700002,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":179970.483734,"text":"e proseguì all'incirca fino al 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"text","t":180380.452885,"text":"and continued roughly until 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":180472.63310500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180478.239227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180483.900958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":180484.18140300002,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":186977.390344,"text":"La superficie della Luna è costituita da rocce e polvere e il suo strato esterno si chiama crosta."},{"kind":"text","t":187666.840134,"text":"The Moon’s surface is made up of rocks and dust, and its outer layer is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":187763.963878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187769.09332900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187774.13364100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187779.479858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187781.307256,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":195836.303783,"text":"Secondo una stima dell'usace, 6 pollici di pioggia potrebbero rompere gli argini danneggiati in precedenza."},{"kind":"text","t":196495.61871,"text":"According to a USACE estimate, 6 inches of rain could break the previously damaged levees."},{"kind":"audio","t":196599.076463,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196604.118825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":196609.30650500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196614.534683,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196619.739302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":196621.01707,"samples":13160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":202828.293284,"text":"Nello specifico, si sostiene che è possibile scoprire"},{"kind":"text","t":203259.97975600002,"text":"Specifically, it is claimed that it is possible to discover"},{"kind":"audio","t":203354.582434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203359.74370400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203365.09772000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":203365.417114,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":210218.463812,"text":"Se una persona sta mentendo, interpretando le microespressioni in modo corretto."},{"kind":"text","t":210627.738795,"text":"If someone is lying, interpreting microexpressions correctly."},{"kind":"audio","t":210713.473727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":210718.694186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":210724.2255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":210726.11437700002,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":220176.27868100003,"text":"Evitate di deturpare questi luoghi imbrattando le strutture con segni o graffiti."},{"kind":"text","t":220669.34976100002,"text":"Avoid defacing these places by marking the structures with signs or graffiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":220767.832501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220772.800844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220778.226369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220783.849541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":220784.48400000003,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":229639.178233,"text":"Il rugito della tigre non è potente come quello del leone, ma assomiglia più ad una frase di parole urlate e rabbiose."},{"kind":"text","t":230361.71012600002,"text":"The tiger’s roar isn’t as powerful as the lion’s, but it resembles a phrase of angry shouts."},{"kind":"audio","t":230460.017759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":230465.266397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":230470.47456600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":230475.82457300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":230481.188429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":230481.519964,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":241072.675553,"text":"Nel XX secolo la ricerca ha dimostrato l'esistenza di due pool di variabilità genetica, ovvero variabilità nascosta e variabilità espressa."},{"kind":"text","t":241882.730967,"text":"In the 20th century, research demonstrated the existence of two pools of genetic variation: hidden variation and expressed variation."},{"kind":"audio","t":241987.284921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":241992.28087400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":241997.65214000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242002.94168800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242008.36518300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":242008.727317,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":242081.76425200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242086.98172100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":242088.808989,"samples":17864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"close","t":252105.060017,"code":1005}]}